<% hero = scene.active_player %><% game = scene.game_session %>Scene <%= scene.position %> of <%= game.scene_budget %>, <%= hero.name %>'s turn.<% unless scene.first? %> Pick up where the last outcome stopped, without retelling it.<% end %><% if (ending = scene.ending) %><% if hero.character.hp.zero? %> <%= hero.name %> has fallen, their health spent. This is the last scene, and the story ends in <%= ending %>.<% else %> This is the last scene, and the story ends in <%= ending %>: <%= game.rolls.where(success: true).count %> of the <%= game.rolls.count %> rolls succeeded.<% end %> The ending is only what the choices and rolls so far bring about: no one, <%= game.party.map(&:name).to_sentence %> included, makes a move in it that those did not set up.<% end %>
<%= hero.name %>: <%= hero.character.sheet %>.
